{"seq":13,"slug":"ios-networking-data-layer","title":"iOS 网络与数据层","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer","rating":{"composite":3.62,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ios-网络与数据层-简介\">iOS 网络与数据层 简介</h1><p>几乎每个 iOS 应用都要做两件事——<strong>从网络取数据</strong>、<strong>把数据存在本地</strong>。这两件事看似基础，做好却不简单：网络要处理异步、错误、重试、后台传输；解码要处理 JSON 与模型的映射、容错；网络层要有清晰的架构（不能把 URLSession 散落各处）；本地存储要在 UserDefaults/Keychain/文件/Core Data/SwiftData/GRDB 之间按场景选对。本 hub 面向需要构建 iOS 应用网络与数据层的工程师，从 <code>URLSession</code>（请求、async/await、上传下载与后台会话）讲起，覆盖 JSON 与模型解码（Codable、解码策略与陷阱、网络错误处理）、网络层架构（API 客户端、端点与路由、重试与韧性），以及本地持久化与缓存（各存储方案的取舍、Core Data/SwiftData、缓存与离线）。贯穿全篇的工程要点是：用 async/await 写清晰的异步网络、用 Codable 做类型安全的解码、把网络收敛进一个有结构的 API 层、按场景（小配置/敏感/大结构化）选对存储、并用缓存与离线让应用在弱网下仍可用。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"urlsession-networking","title":"URLSession 网络请求","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"urlsession-requests","title":"URLSession 请求基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking/urlsession-requests"},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-await-networking","title":"async/await 异步网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking/async-await-networking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"upload-download-background","title":"上传下载与后台会话","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/urlsession-networking/upload-download-background"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"json-and-model-decoding","title":"JSON 与模型解码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/json-and-model-decoding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"codable-basics","title":"Codable 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/json-and-model-decoding/codable-basics"},{"seq":2,"s